        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_908007915_copy_": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "chris.kleckner@stryker.com",
          "text": "<h1><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Rapid response ready: What nurses need to know before the team arrives</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Evidence-informed strategies to support rapid response activation and communication.</h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Clinical deterioration is rarely sudden. It may precede cardiac arrest, and timely intervention may be beneficial. This on-demand webinar equips nurses with practical tools to recognize early warning signs, take decisive action, communicate clearly with rapid response teams and document effectively. This on-demand webinar was presented by <a href=\"https://www.nurse.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nurse.com</a>.</span></p>\n<div><p><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Learning Objectives:</b></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Define clinical criteria and patient scenarios that warrant Rapid Response Team activation</span></li>\n<li><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Discuss key nursing actions before the team arrives, including reassessment and initial interventions</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Review how to effectively support the response team during and after the event</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand the importance of timely documentation, follow-up, and interprofessional communication</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 28 2026 18:19:09 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
